 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "trees lists binary trees, each in LeetCode level-order form (values and null placeholders, trailing nulls removed, [] for an empty tree). For each tree except the last, from left to right, and for every node position in it (the path from the root), compute the node's neighbor sum (its value plus the values of its existing children) and add it to the node at the same position in the last tree, creating that node with value 0 first when it is absent. Source trees are never changed. Return the resulting last tree in the same level-order form.",
  "provenance": [
